<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 28-FEB.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 28-FEB.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Giuette, with 50 mph winds, is in the Mozambique Channel near 22s/40e, moving south at 5 mph. This motion is expected to continue as the storm slowly strengthens during the next 24 hours, threatning mostly shipping.</p>
</text>
